{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1511016001:0":{"text":"듀라, 가증스러운 듀라...","source_cn":"艾雅，可恨的艾雅……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80A629499583FF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511016002:1":{"text":"어째서 내 영역까지 와서, 나와 페르세우스의 운명에 간섭하려는 거지?!","source_cn":"为什么要踏足我的神域，为什么要来干涉我与珀尔修斯的命运？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB02054CE0A02ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511016003:1":{"text":"생명의 나무는 너 혼자만의 것이 아니야! 네가 가진 신의 권력으로 페르세우스를 돌아오게 해, 어서 내 곁으로 돌아오게 하란 말이야!","source_cn":"生命树不是你一个人的所有物！行使你的神权，让珀尔修斯回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9B74C1FA8BEED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511016004:0":{"text":"...생명의 규칙은 제가 바꿀 수 있는 것이 아니에요. 지켜야만 하는 것이죠.","source_cn":"……生命的规则，只能遵守，那也并非我能撼动之物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259299E6845591F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511016005:0":{"text":"신의 권력...? 생명의 규칙?","source_cn":"神权……？生命的规则？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17819FC0A78C08B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511016006:0":{"text":"멀린, 도대체 나한테 뭘 숨기고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"梅林，你瞒了我什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0240E37C8BE9AE03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511016007:0":{"text":"같이 다니면서도, 정체를 모르고 있었다니.","source_cn":"你们与她同行一路，竟然不知她是谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86300F841BB01FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511016008:1":{"text":"위대하고, 고귀한 <style=\"highlight\">생명의 여신</style>! 대체 인간에게 얼마나 많은 거짓말을 한 거지? 역시 거짓말은 네 특기였군!","source_cn":"伟大的——崇高的<style=highlight>生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x238B0F66E6C5D5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511016009:0":{"text":"네 곁에 있는 루나애니를 좀 봐. 저 아이는 내 신도임에도 불구하고 날 증오하는 눈빛으로 바라보고 있다고!","source_cn":"看看你身边那个兽人孩子——她明明是我的信徒，却用仇视的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4913F277EDAA1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511016010:1":{"text":"내 영토, 내 신도, 내 창조물, 내 사랑... 이제 더 이상 네게 빼앗길 수 없어!","source_cn":"我的疆土，我的信徒，我的造物，我的爱……你再也不能夺走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDD2F2AE9DE69DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511016011:1":{"text":"멀린이... 신이라고요?","source_cn":"梅林……是神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C2FAEEADA93F7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511016012:1":{"text":"닥쳐라, 배신자. 넌 내 창조물이니 나를 섬겨야만 했어!","source_cn":"闭嘴，叛徒，你是我的造物，本应崇敬我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF8F92229CD39494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511016013:0":{"text":"...전 이제 그 어떤 신도 믿지 않아요.","source_cn":"……我已经不崇敬任何神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC49CFDA33F61EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511016014:0":{"text":"전 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님만 믿는다구요!","source_cn":"我信仰，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C64126687A1A3E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님만 믿는다구요!","female":"전 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님만 믿는다구요!","variant_male_record_index":"175883","variant_female_record_index":"175884","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511016015:0":{"text":"...그만! 페르세우스만 되살리면, 널 생명의 나무로 돌아가게 해주겠다!","source_cn":"——够了！等我唤回珀尔修斯，就让你回归生命树！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7C0BC43FBDFC9C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1511016016:0":{"text":"당신은 페르세우스를 구할 수 없을 거예요, 오르파가.","source_cn":"你救不了珀尔修斯，奥法迦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28CA5BD2C87BCBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511016017:0":{"text":"인간은 모두 생명의 나무에 달린 나뭇잎이에요. 잎이 지면, 인간은 삶의 마지막, 즉 죽음을 맞이하게 되는 거죠.","source_cn":"凡人皆是生命树上的一枚叶片。当叶片凋落，凡人也迎来生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC7715296A79024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1511016018:0":{"text":"오르파가, 현실을 직시하세요. “페르세우스”라는 잎은 이미 졌고, 그의 영혼은 생명의 나무로 돌아갔어요. 같은 자리에 새로운 잎이 자란다고 해도, 그 사람은 더 이상 당신이 사랑하는 사람이 아니라고요.","source_cn":"认清现实吧，奥法迦。属于珀尔修斯的那一片叶已经凋落，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x190A915D491AE0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1511016019:0":{"text":"죽음의 신에게 부탁한다면 모르겠지만... 하지만 신이 과연 또 다른 신에게 간청할 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"除非你向死神祈求……但一位神，会向另一位神祈求吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F95036A2C7EF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1511016020:0":{"text":"게다가 죽음의 신이 지금 어디에 있는지는 아무도 모를 거예요.","source_cn":"谁又知道死神现在何方呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF4A49BBF595A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1511016021:1":{"text":"아니... 죽음의 신은 페르세우스의 영혼을 데려갈 수 없어. 내가 페르세우스의 죽음을 금한다고!","source_cn":"不……死神休想染指珀尔修斯的灵魂，我禁止他的死亡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED0F3D29F180C15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1511016022:0":{"text":"너와 나 모두 똑같은 신이야! 넌 생명을 불어넣을 수 있는데, 나는 왜 안 된다는 거야?!","source_cn":"你我皆是神！你能赐予生命，我为何不能——？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x446826B08CA483E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1511016023:0":{"text":"오르파가가 아직도 생명의 나무의 힘을 끌어내고 있어!","source_cn":"她还在抽取生命树的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224B612681F1DD6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1511016024:0":{"text":"오르파가...","source_cn":"奥法迦……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1625AA20721FFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1511016025:1":{"text":"날 막을 생각 마!","source_cn":"——休想再阻止我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B8A867E13B07F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1511016026:0":{"text":"반드시 성공할 거야... <style=\"highlight\">페르세우스가 곧 깨어날 거라고</style>!","source_cn":"我会成功的……<style=highlight>他马上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76DF4E8C2DC4EAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1511016027:0":{"text":"페르세우스... 우린 영원히, 영원히... 영원히 함께 할 수 있을 거야!","source_cn":"珀尔修斯……我们将永远永远……永远地在一起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE2C19844DDAAF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:狩猎神奥法迦":{"text":"사냥의 신 오르파가","source":"狩猎神奥法迦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":27,"speaker_count":4}}